          <blockquote class="book-page-text">
            <p>“Let’s make this simple,” he said after a moment. “You help me stay aligned. On track. Clear.”</p>
            <p><span class="book-page-machine">“Understood.”</span></p>
            <p>“Help me…” He hesitated. The word he’d wanted to avoid tumbled out. “…stay human.”</p>
            <p>The cursor blinked as if considering. Then the text appeared with a deliberateness that seemed almost kind.</p>
            <p><span class="book-page-machine">“That is a complex request.”</span></p>
            <p>He shook his head, smiling. “Yeah. But I think we can figure it out. Together.”</p>
          </blockquote>
        </figure>
